{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12337","headline":"送郑书记 · 钱起","name":"送郑书记","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"决胜无遗策，辞天便起缨。\n出身唯殉死，报国且能兵。\n受命麒膦殿，参谋骠骑营。\n短箫催别酒，斜日驻前旌。\n义勇千夫敌，风沙万里行。\n几年丹阙下，侯印锡书生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12337.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12337","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}